      {
        "@value": "fried_chicken. Ingredients: CHICKEN, WATER, BLEACHED WHEAT FLOUR, BLEACHED ENRICHED WHEAT FLOUR (WHEAT FLOUR, NIACIN, REDUCED IRON, THIAMINE MONONITRATE, RIBOFLAVIN, FOLIC ACID), WHEAT FLOUR, CONTAINS 2% OR LESS OF SALT, SODIUM PHOSPHATES, SPICES, GARLIC POWDER, DEXTROSE POWDERED BUTTERMILK, AUTOLYZED YEAST EXTRACT AND TORULA YEAST, EGG WHITE SOLIDS, LEAVENING (SODIUM BICARBONATE, SODIUM ALUMINUM PHOSPHATE), WHEAT GLUTEN, LEAVENING (SODIUM ACID PYROPHOSPHATE, SODIUM BICARBONATE, CORN STARCH, MONOCALCIUM PHOSPHATE), SEASONING (SALT, SODIUM TRIPOLYPHOSPHATE, MODIFIED FOOD STARCH, DRIED BUTTERMILK, AUTOLYZED YEAST EXTRACT, NATURAL FLAVORS {WITH ENZYME MODIFIED MILKFAT}, XANTHAN GUM, DRIED GARLIC AND ONION, CITRIC ACID).. Nutritional components: calcium_ca_fried_chicken: 0.0 mg; fiber_total_dietary_fried_chicken: 0.0 g; energy_fried_chicken: 274.0 kcal; iron_fe_fried_chicken: 0.43 mg; potassium_k_fried_chicken: 119.0 mg; vitamin_a_rae_fried_chicken: 21.0 µg; fatty_acids_total_monounsaturated_fried_chicken: 5.95 g; sodium_na_fried_chicken: 726.0 mg; total_lipid_fat_fried_chicken: 17.86 g; fatty_acids_total_polyunsaturated_fried_chicken: 7.14 g; protein_fried_chicken: 13.1 g; vitamin_c_total_ascorbic_acid_fried_chicken: 0.0 mg"
      }
