    "http://example.org/food#hasTextDescription": [
      {
        "@value": "spam_musubi. Ingredients: RICE, WATER, TERIYAKI SAUCE (WATER, DEXTROSE, BROWN SUGAR, SOY SAUCE (WATER, SOYBEANS, WHEAT, SALT), HIGH FRUCTOSE CORN SYRUP, SALT, MOLASSES, YEAST EXTRACT, SODIUM BENZOATE (AS PRESERVATIVE), CITRIC ACID), SPAM (PORK WITH HAM, MECHANICALLY SEPARATED CHICKEN, WATER, SALT, MODIFIED POTATO STARCH, SUGAR, SODIUM PHOSPHATES, POTASSIUM CHLORIDE, SODIUM NITRITE), FURIKAKE SEASONING (WHITE SESAME SEEDS, SEAWEED, BLACK SESAME SEEDS, SUGAR, SALT, HYDROLYZED VEGETABLES PROTEIN POWDER, MALTODEXTRIN YEAST EXTRACT POWDER, E635, DISODIUM SUCCINATE), SALT (SALT, YELLOW PRUSSIATE OF SODA), CORNSTARCH, SOYBEAN OIL, ROASTED SEAWEED [LAVER]. CARAMEL SAUCE (MOLASSES, WATER), ENZYME PREPARATION (HYDROGENATED MALTOSE, MALT-OLIGO SACCHARIDE, GLUCOSE, ALPHA-GLUCOSIDASE).. Nutritional components: cholesterol_original_spam_musubi_original: 7.0 mg; sugars_added_original_spam_musubi_original: 4.1 g; energy_original_spam_musubi_original: 216.0 kcal; fatty_acids_total_trans_original_spam_musubi_original: 0.0 g; protein_original_spam_musubi_original: 4.05 g; calcium_ca_original_spam_musubi_original: 14.0 mg; potassium_k_original_spam_musubi_original: 0.0 mg; sodium_na_original_spam_musubi_original: 635.0 mg; total_sugars_original_spam_musubi_original: 4.05 g; vitamin_d_d2_d3_original_spam_musubi_original: 0.0 µg; iron_fe_original_spam_musubi_original: 0.73 mg; carbohydrate_by_difference_original_spam_musubi_original: 41.89 g"
      }
    ],
