      {
        "@value": "grilled_cheese_sandwich. Ingredients: WHEAT BERRY (UNBLEACHED ENRICHED FLOUR [WHEAT FLOUR, MALTED BARLEY FLOUR, NIACIN, REDUCED IRON, THIAMINE MONONITRATE, RIBOFLAVIN, FOLIC ACID], WATER, FULLY REFINED SOYBEAN OIL, SALTED BUTTER [PASTEURIZED CREAM, SALT], YEAST, COARSE CRACKED WHEAT, WHEAT GLUTEN, HONEY, CANOLA OIL, AND 2% OR LESS OF CARAMEL COLOR, SALT, GRANULATED SUGAR, CALCIUM PROPIONATE [TO RETAIN FRESHNESS], MALT, DOUGH IMPROVER [MALTED WHEAT FLOUR, ENZYMES AND 2% OR LESS OF ASCORBIC ACID], ENZYMES, SUNFLOWER LECITHIN, ASCORBIC ACID), LOW-MOISTURE PART-SKIM MOZZARELLA CHEESE (PASTEURIZED PART-SKIM MILK, CHEESE CULTURES, SALT, NATAMYCIN [A NATURAL MOLD INHIBITOR], ENZYMES, SOY LECITHIN [NON-STICKING AGENT]), GOAT CHEESE SAUCE (WATER, GOAT CHEESE [PASTEURIZED GOAT MILK, SALT, CHEESE CULTURES, MICROBIAL RENNET], CREAM, BUTTER, SALT, MODIFIED FOOD STARCH, CITRUS FIBER, XANTHAN GUM), CARAMELIZED ONION JAM (RED ONION, BROWN SUGAR, VINEGAR [BALSAMIC, DISTILLED & RED WINE VINEGAR], CORN SYRUP, RED WINE, WATER, CANOLA OIL, PECTIN, ORANGE JUICE CONCENTRATE, BLACKSTRAP MOLASSES, SALT, BLACK CARROT POWDER, POTASSIUM SORBATE, CARAMEL COLOR, TAMARIND, SPICES, CITRIC ACID), BACON (CURED WITH: WATER, SALT, SUGAR, SODIUM ERYTHORBATE AND/OR SODIUM ASCORBATE, SODIUM NITRITE, MAY CONTAIN NATURAL SMOKE FLAVORING, SODIUM PHOSPHATE).. Nutritional components: total_lipid_fat_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 12.82 g; calcium_ca_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 224.0 mg; cholesterol_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 29.0 mg; fatty_acids_total_saturated_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 5.77 g; energy_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 288.0 kcal; fatty_acids_total_trans_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 0.0 g; vitamin_a_iu_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 64.0 IU; total_sugars_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 4.49 g; sodium_na_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 571.0 mg; vitamin_c_total_ascorbic_acid_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 5.8 mg; fiber_total_dietary_grilled_cheese_sandwich: 2.6 g"
      }
