        "@value": "clam_chowder. Ingredients: CREAM, CLAM BROTH FROM CONCENTRATE, CLAM MEAT, POTATOES, ONIONS, CONTAINS 2% OR LESS OF: BUTTER (CREAM, SALT), GARLIC (GARLIC, WATER), FISH STOCK (POLLOCK, SALT), MODIFIED CORN STARCH, SALT, NISIN PREPARATION AND SPICE.. Nutritional components: vitamin_a_iu_clam_chowder: 408.0 IU; iron_fe_clam_chowder: 0.29 mg; total_lipid_fat_clam_chowder: 8.57 g; calcium_ca_clam_chowder: 41.0 mg; fatty_acids_total_trans_clam_chowder: 0.0 g; fatty_acids_total_saturated_clam_chowder: 5.31 g; protein_clam_chowder: 3.67 g; vitamin_c_total_ascorbic_acid_clam_chowder: 3.7 mg; fiber_total_dietary_clam_chowder: 0.4 g; sodium_na_clam_chowder: 290.0 mg; cholesterol_clam_chowder: 35.0 mg; carbohydrate_by_difference_clam_chowder: 6.53 g"
